RUcXJhbFNfOTlfSTVvR1E2aHRIOGMyQWRKai1lSW9QTmN3UGRrWGJpS0pxcFZmbl8yMnNVTWRtaXEzTVdLZjhn?oc=5","date":"2026-10-07","zh":""},{"title":"Everpure Stock Surges As S&P 500 Inclusion Fuels Breakout","src":"StocksToTrade","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE5xSmZJZHo5bFFjcmxxc2NGT3BYSGVBZktNOWFDanJ2a3YxYUhkSko4QmxwOGRUb0Z4LTVubzUyYlFpb2ZlY0ppVzJiMnZaNHFKMzRnV21XRDYwOGJPTXJoSzJONUZOUTlIMWoxdkRGSQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-07","zh":"標普 500 指數助推恆純股價飆漲"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-25","period":"2026-02-01","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1474432/000147443226000027/pstg-20260201.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Everpure, formerly known as Pure Storage, is a global technology company providing an integrated storage and data management platform. Data is foundational to our customers' business transformation and increasingly central to their operational resilience and competitive differentiation. As data volumes expand and artificial intelligence (AI) becomes more deeply embedded in customers' operations, the ability to store, manage, govern, and derive greater value from their data is becoming as important as the infrastructure used to store it.","zh":"Everpure前身為Pure Storage，是一家提供整合式儲存和資料管理平台的全球科技公司。數據是客戶業務轉型的基礎，對於他們的營運彈性和競爭優勢越來越重要。隨著資料量的擴大和人工智慧 (AI) 越來越深入地融入客戶的營運中，儲存、管理、治理資料並從資料中獲取更大價值的能力變得與用於儲存資料的基礎設施一樣重要。"},{"en":"We began as a provider of flash-based storage systems. Over time, we have evolved into a company that delivers a cloud experience with an intelligent, unified storage and data management platform (the Everpure Platform) that virtualizes data across on-premises, hybrid and public cloud, and edge environments into a single storage layer with consistent control, built-in automation and continuous modernization. We are executing a focused strategy to modernize and simplify data infrastructure for customers as AI adoption increases and power, space, and operational constraints intensify. Our vision of an all-flash data center integrates our foundation of simplicity and reliability with four major market trends that are impacting all organizations:","zh":"我們最初是一家基於快閃記憶體的儲存系統提供者。隨著時間的推移，我們已經發展成為一家透過智慧、統一儲存和資料管理平台（Everpure 平台）提供雲端體驗的公司，該平台將本地、混合雲和公有雲以及邊緣環境中的資料虛擬化為具有一致控制、內建自動化和持續現代化的單一儲存層。隨著人工智慧採用的增加以及電力、空間和營運限制的加劇，我們正在執行一項重點策略，為客戶實現資料基礎設施的現代化和簡化。我們對全快閃資料中心的願景將簡單性和可靠性的基礎與影響所有組織的四大市場趨勢結合："},{"en":"With the Everpure Platform, customers can build their own Enterprise Data Cloud (EDC), an architectural approach to storage and data management that allows organizations to centrally manage a virtualized cloud of data with unified control — spanning on-premises, hybrid, and public cloud environments — enabling intelligent, autonomous data management and consistent governance across the entire environment.","zh":"借助 Everpure 平台，客戶可以建立自己的企業資料雲 (EDC)，這是一種儲存和資料管理的架構方法，可讓組織透過統一控制來集中管理虛擬化資料雲（涵蓋本地、混合和公有雲環境），從而在整個環境中實現智慧、自主的資料管理和一致的治理。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Product designs that help customers reduce their carbon footprint and contribute to meeting their environmental sustainability and savings goals;","zh":"產品設計可協助客戶減少碳足跡，並有助於實現其環境永續性和節省目標；"},{"en":"We believe we compete favorably with our competitors on these factors as we continue to take market share. However, many of our competitors have substantially greater financial, technical and other resources, greater name recognition, larger sales and marketing budgets, broader distribution and larger and more mature intellectual property portfolios.","zh":"我們相信，隨著我們繼續佔據市場份額，我們在這些因素上可以與競爭對手進行有利的競爭。然而，我們的許多競爭對手擁有更多的財務、技術和其他資源、更高的知名度、更大的銷售和行銷預算、更廣泛的分銷以及更大、更成熟的智慧財產權組合。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Our global customer base is over 14,500 at the end of fiscal 2026. Both large enterprises and smaller organizations with limited IT expertise or budgets benefit from using our technology. We have deployed our products and subscription services to customers across multiple industry verticals and geographies. We define a customer as an entity that purchases our products and services either from one of our channel partners or from us directly.","zh":"截至 2026 財年末，我們的全球客戶群已超過 14,500 個。 IT 專業知識或預算有限的大型企業和小型組織都可以從使用我們的技術中受益。我們已經向多個垂直行業和地區的客戶部署了我們的產品和訂閱服務。我們將客戶定義為從我們的通路合作夥伴或直接從我們購買我們的產品和服務的實體。"},{"en":"Our enterprise business model supports the largest global organizations, including hyperscalers and managed service providers (MSPs). Today, we are in approximately 64% of Fortune 500 companies, and the loyalty of our customers is reflected in our market-leading, certified customer Net Promoter Score (NPS) of 84 as of December 31, 2025.","zh":"我們的企業業務模式支援全球最大的組織，包括超大規模企業和主機服務供應商 (MSP)。如今，大約 64% 的財富 500 強公司都在使用我們的服務，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們市場領先的經過認證的客戶淨推薦值 (NPS) 為 84，這反映了我們客戶的忠誠度。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in the intensely competitive data storage market that is characterized by constant change. Changes in the application requirements, data center infrastructure trends and the broader technology landscape result in evolving customer requirements for capacity, performance scalability and enterprise features of storage systems. Our main competitors include legacy vendors, such as Dell EMC, NetApp, Hitachi Vantara, HP Enterprise, and IBM, each of which offer a broad range of systems targeting various use cases and end markets and have the technical and financial resources to bring competitive products to market.","zh":"我們所處的資料儲存市場競爭激烈，且不斷變化。應用程式需求、資料中心基礎設施趨勢和更廣泛的技術領域的變化導致客戶對儲存系統的容量、效能可擴展性和企業功能的要求不斷變化。我們的主要競爭對手包括傳統供應商，例如 Dell EMC、NetApp、Hitachi Vantara、HP Enterprise 和 IBM，這些供應商均提供針對各種用例和終端市場的廣泛系統，並擁有將有競爭力的產品推向市場的技術和財務資源。"},{"en":"In addition, we compete against cloud providers and vendors of hyperconverged products. Some large-scale cloud providers, known for developing storage systems internally, offer alternatives to our data storage solutions for a variety of customer workloads. Our market attracts new startups and more highly specialized vendors, as well as other vendors that may continue to acquire or bundle products that compete with our offerings. All of our competitors utilize a broad range of competitive strategies.","zh":"此外，我們也與雲端供應商和超融合產品供應商競爭。一些以內部開發儲存系統而聞名的大型雲端供應商，為各種客戶工作負載提供了我們的資料儲存解決方案的替代方案。我們的市場吸引了新的新創公司和更高度專業化的供應商，以及可能繼續收購或捆綁與我們的產品競爭的產品的其他供應商。我們所有的競爭對手都採用廣泛的競爭策略。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-02-01","items":[{"name":"Product","val":1971678000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":1691165000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":3662843000},"geo":{"end":"2026-02-01","items":[{"name":"US","val":2464546000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":1198297000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":3662843000}},"peers":["NTNX","ANET","Z","YELP","ZS"]}}